      "title": "demisexual",
      "position": { "x": 660, "y": 600 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "content": "Experiencing sexual attraction only after a strong emotional bond has formed. A specific position on the asexual spectrum that depends on the Split Attraction Model to be expressed cleanly.",
